          "Engage the Native American community (approximately 7.8% demographic gap) with specific fluency on Indian Health Service access, tribal healthcare coordination, and respect for pueblo governance — not token acknowledgment. This constituency deserves authentic partnership, not absorption into broader minority narratives.",
          "Treat the unopposed 2024 result as a warning rather than a guarantee: the absence of opposition reflects this cycle's political context, not durable consolidation. Any competitive cycle will test whether the incumbent has built genuine constituent relationships or simply held the seat. Continuous engagement is non-negotiable."
