          "Do not treat 83% as a durable floor: this is a young, renter-heavy, working-class constituency that votes Democratic but evaluates on economic delivery; any incumbent who assumes the margin is safe while housing costs and wages stagnate relative to cost of living will find credible opposition emerging in the next cycle."
