          "Recognize that with 8.27% of the district's population in categories other than Hispanic and white, every percentage point of support matters—Asian, Black, and American Indian voters in a 50-50 district are not swing constituencies, they are decisive constituencies whose engagement and turnout can determine narrow outcomes."
