          "Make K-12 education and workforce development central: with college attainment at 14.8%, the lowest in comparable sequences, educational access and K-12 quality are direct determinants of whether young people in this district have pathways to economic mobility; a representative's record on school funding, vocational training, and education policy is a material accountability measure.",
          "Distinguish between unopposed incumbent status and constituent loyalty: the 100% 2024 result reflects lack of opposition, not satisfaction; any incumbent who campaigns as though this margin is durable rather than contingent on whether working-class constituents perceive material improvement will miss the primary vulnerability of a low-income district without strong economic growth."
