          "Build active constituent infrastructure while unopposed—use the current period without Republican opposition to deepen relationships with tribal governments, community organizations, and working-class households so that the seat is genuinely durable when opposition inevitably emerges, rather than discovering vulnerability only when a credible challenger appears.",
          "Do not treat unopposed status as evidence of durable partisan attachment—the 100% result reflects absence of opposition, not absence of economic concerns or latent swing constituencies; maintain continuous engagement with the ~36% AIAN population and the working-class Anglo households as active constituents who will evaluate based on delivery, not inherited loyalty."
