          "Lead with economic platform for working-to-middle-class households: at $60,589 median income, 33.3% renter rate, and 23.8% college attainment, the constituency is evaluating on housing costs, wage growth, and service delivery—not inherited partisan loyalty. Both Hispanic and Anglo households in this income range have aligned economic concerns; a candidate who unifies them around that shared platform is stronger than one who defaults to demographic targeting.",
